{"resourceIdentifier":"4677","resourceName":"Jinshan Songlin Market Swine Manure Utilization Project","description":"Jinshan Songlin Market Swine Manure Utilization Project (hereinafter referred to as the project) locates in Wanchun Village, Langxia Town, Jinshan District, Shanghai, P.R China. The project builds an anaerobic animal manure treatment system for the treatment of swine manure in Jinshan Modern Agricultural Park Songlin Market  Swine Farm. The project uses animal manure waste as ferment material to produce biogas in the Completely Stirred Tank Reactor (CSTR) type anaerobic digesters. At this stage, part of the recovered biogas will be used to generate electricity at the biogas power plant for the daily use of the swine farm. According to the feasibility study report, the designed installed capacity of the biogas power plant is 0.52MW. Waste heat recovery boiler will also be installed at the biogas power plant to recover and supply waste heat to the auxiliary equipment of the project. The residual waste from the CSTR digesters will be used as organic fertilizer directly on agricultural land in the project vicinity.\r\nPrior to the implementation of the project, the animal manure waste was left to decay in anaerobic manure management system (lagoon) and methane is emitted to the atmosphere directly without any methane recovery and destruction facility.\r\nThe project is expected to avoid GHG emission of methane through recovery and destruction of biogas.","location":{"latitude":30.805471,"longitude":121.210741},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-09-19","endExclusive":"2023-10-20","endInclusive":"2023-10-19"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4677"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Shanghai"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Shanghai Songlin Industrial & Trade Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Shanghai, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"17927"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AMS-III.D."}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"27/11/2024"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 15/01/2022 - 14/01/2029"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=96391&IDKEY=slksjoiuwqowrnoiuomnckjashoufifmln902309ksdflku098w132923189","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"01-Songlin_VCS-PD_20230901_clean.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-09-01T07:41:02.227Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=96839&IDKEY=d903q4jsafkasjfu90amnmasdfkaidflnmdf9348r09dmfasdfu133540981","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"03-Songlin_VCS_Listing-Representation-Single-PP-v4.2.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-09-08T15:06:58.17Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=96840&IDKEY=8kjalskjf098234kj28098sfkjlf098098kl32lasjdflkj909j133542360","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"03-Songlin_VCS_Listing-Representation-Single-PP-v4.2.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-09-08T15:07:01.607Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=103921&IDKEY=3iofj09234rm9oq4jndsma80vcalksdjf98cxkjaf90823nmq39143307059","documentType":"Registration Representatio